WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.730
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:14.450
Headmaster, for what purpose do you continue forcing trials upon her?

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.450
I'm unsure who you're referring to.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.950
Nijino Yume-chan.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.410
You canceled my concert without warning

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.920
and made her perform her first solo live in the Grand Hall. {did I say great hall last time? I meant grand}

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.090
This must all be part of some plot.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.100
Is it because of the power 
Yume-chan holds? Because she's special?

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.100
Are you finished?

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.940
There is no need for a top idol like you to concern yourself with an inexperienced newcomer.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:45.980
Take your leave.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:51.190
That I shall.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.580
<i>You're right, Nijino Yume is special.</i>

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.290
<i>And exactly because she is special...</i>

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.420
Your performance was great.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.710
It was exactly what I'd hope for from my rival.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.750
Was that really because of my own abilities?

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:13.210
What do you mean?

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:18.760
It felt like there was some sort of power pushing me beyond my abilities.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.600
That just means you're strong under pressure. {damn this line}

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.440
You were the one up there singing, so that makes it your own ability.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.440
You really think so?

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.240
The red carpet!

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.950
That can only mean one thing!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:48.120
Yume-chan, thank you very much for the other day.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:53.960
The changes in my schedule must have cast a large burden on you.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.430
I-It wasn't a burden at all!

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:01.470
I also have to apologize for not being able to draw a large audience.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:06.480
But I heard that those who did come left very satisfied.

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.980
You must've worked hard.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.980
Hime-senpai!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.650
This is the top idol of S4. {no no, she is THE top idol}

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:13.480
Huh?

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:19.490
Shiratori Hime, seen here kindly consoling a younger, less experienced idol.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:23.240
Oh, Yamaguchi-san. 
What are you doing here?

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.500
Can't you tell, jumbo ribbon?

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.500
Hime is going to be featured on a show called Fervent Continent.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.960
These two are the director and cameraman for that show.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:38.930
They're doing total coverage of a day in the life of Hime-chan. {yeah but this still sounds fine}

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:40.510
So now you know.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:43.850
He does quite a variety of work.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:47.520
Total coverage of Hime-senpai... how lucky.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:49.940
Would you like to cover me too?

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:50.900
Huh?

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:54.440
I want to thank you and make up for the trouble I caused.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:59.530
If you don't mind, would you like to be my one-day manager tomorrow?

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.530
Your manager?

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:07.700
Yume-chan, this is great! You'll be able to observe Hime-senpai's work up close as her manager!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.040
That gets me going! {one day she'll say this for someone else and it'll be good}

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:14.040
I'll do it! Please let me be your one-day manager!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.100
I'm gonna get there before our meet-up time.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.560
Goodness, I'm impressed with how early you are.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.530
I wish!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.860
Let's see, S4's dorm should be just up ahead.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.870
That's S4's dorm?!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.160
Whoa, it's more like a castle.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.000
Good morning.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.960
Hime-senpai, why are you dressed like that?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.260
I was jogging around campus.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:28.680
Jogging? But your work schedule starts first thing in the morning.

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.760
It's part of my routine.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:35.770
<i>She wakes up this early every single morning to train.</i>

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.650
Good morning.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.270
We're looking forward to working with you again today.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.360
So am I.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:46.280
Yamaguchi-san, Yume-chan, I'll be in your care. {poor cameraman-san}

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.030
I-I'll do my best. {hm, I feel it fits}

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.040
Hello, and welcome to Makiko's Room.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:06:03.050
Today's visitor is a middle school student and top idol, Shiratori Hime-san from S4.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.800
Thank you for having me.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.810
It's a pleasure to meet you. 
You certainly have a charming smile.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:20.310
And I simply love your maki-maki roll hairstyle, Makiko-san.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.440
Unbelievably, you made your debut as a zero-year-old baby.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:29.320
You even modeled for a smattering of magazines.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.830
In time you grew old enough to perform in dramas as a child actor.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:37.620
I've heard that you were all smiles despite being surrounded by adults.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.330
Did they not make you nervous?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:45.840
Perhaps due to my familiarity with cameras from as long as I can remember, I was never nervous.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:50.380
Following that, you entered the 
idol school, Four Star Academy. {this is the first time they ever called it an idol school}

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:57.350
In your very first summer there, you gained legend status when you were chosen for S4.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:02.860
And now you work in singing, dancing, modeling,

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.360
as well as acting for dramas and movies.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.360
You're well versed in many different fields.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.370
You are the very definition of a natural-born idol.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.410
She took the words right out of my mouth. Hime-senpai is a prodigy.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.370
Do you really think so?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:23.830
Watch closely, and see what it means to be a top idol.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.020
My, what a lovely color!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.850
W-Well then, we'll be relying on you for the commercial.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.360
Of course, I'm honored to be here.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.570
Thank you for your help.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.860
Thank you for your help.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.710
Would you use Hime Rouge as well?

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.040
Very nice.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.550
Very nice, very nice!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.380
Really, really good!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.010
I want to use Hime Rouge now!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.140
After a short break we'll film the commercial proper.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:17.890
Okay.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.390
Hime-senpai, well done out there.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.390
I brought you a—

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.650
Oh crap! {or whatever}

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.160
Just what do you think you're doing?!

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.410
I-I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.700
Do you think an apology can fix this?! {what's with grown men always bullying yume?}

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:39.910
Is there a spare?

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.410
The dress was custom made, so we don't have an extra!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.580
Do you understand what you've done?!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.960
I'm so sorry!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.800
Only a small area was stained.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.340
I should be able to obscure it with my movements.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.930
What do you think of this?

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.060
Very nice!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.520
Very nice, very nice!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.440
That's absolutely better than before!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.940
She doesn't simply overcome obstacles.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:13.070
Shiratori Hime turns them into a positive that brings a shine to any situation.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.570
Amazing...

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.280
That concludes the filming.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.080
I can't apologize enough for before.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.790
Everyone makes mistakes. Don't beat yourself up over it.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:27.580
Right...

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.590
You have a horde of fans out-waiting for you. {ep 111}

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:35.970
Yume-chan, is there time in my schedule before my next appointment?

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.850
Yes, the previous one ended exactly on time.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.970
Perfect. Let's head out.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.860
Hello everyone!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:06.290
Could we have the tallest people stand in back and everyone in front kneel down?

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.710
Yes, exactly.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.960
Yume-chan, please take our photo.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.290
Oh, of course.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.340
Here we go.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.380
Say cheese!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.350
Thank you for all of your support.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:27.390
I'll post the picture on my blog, so be sure to check it out!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.020
Okay!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.900
What made you step outside to meet your fans?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:44.540
I'm only who I am now due to my fans, so I try to interact with them as much as possible.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.040
Hime-senpai!

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.460
Senpai? Is something the matter?

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:52.210
No...

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.550
It's going to rain.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.050
But it's sunny out.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:00.800
It'll rain.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:08.390
There's something I'd like to eat for lunch. Do you mind?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:23.070
This is my favorite curry house.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.950
I'd like to order my usual.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.330
Very well.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.500
I'll take what Hime-senpai's having.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.580
Huh? Can't I?

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.500
Y-You may. Very well then.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.420
Thank you for the meal.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.840
Thank you for the food.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.350
It's delicious.

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.400
Yeah, it's great!

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.230
Spicy!

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:04.660
That's the super ultimate curry, the spiciest one we have.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:08.200
Spicy curry is beneficial to both beauty and health.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.620
It heats you throughout your body.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.620
I'm definitely feeling hot.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.040
Eating this curry perks me right up.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.180
Thank you very much.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.680
<i>Hime-senpai is way too unbelievable!</i>

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:34.190
Excuse me, but aren't you Shiratori Hime-san?

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.190
That's right.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.310
It's really her!

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:39.230
Can we get a picture with you?

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.440
I'd love to.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.820
Are you ready? Say cheese!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.410
Does it look okay?

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.370
Thank you so much.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.920
Wait, aren't you Nijino Yume-chan?

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.840
Well, yes.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:03.300
I knew it! I saw your last performance on Aikatsu TV.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.840
Me too! I became your fan right away.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.350
Th-Thank you so much!

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.770
Can we get a picture with you?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.390
Yes, of course!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:18.860
Oh, but I'm on the job right now...

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:24.360
Yume-chan, interacting with your fans is an important part of your Aikatsu.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.490
You ready?

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.080
On the jump!{I don't health enough to this}

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.250
Aikatsu!

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.170
Thanks again!

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:39.290
Thank you for speaking with me!{ewfui9oheriofe}

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.050
You have a recording for a music program at 3 PM.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.300
And right now it's 2 PM. {nobody should get annoyed at this}

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:49.300
Since we have some free time, 
why don't we rest in the dressing room?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.550
<b>Shiratori Hime</b>

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:54.480
This is your dressing room? It's huge!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.310
The mirror's so big!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.560
And these flowers are pretty!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.320
Are these all presents from your fans?

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:07.570
Hime-senpai! Are you okay?

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:11.830
I'm fine. This always happens.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.620
Whenever it rains, I begin to feel under the weather.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.330
I'm sensitive to the low pressure.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:24.300
I had hoped to stave it off by having that spicy curry.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:29.470
Isn't there anything we can do to help you feel better? Some kind of medicine?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.680
There's nothing. All I can do is wait for the rain to stop.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:34.850
You can't be serious...

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.850
I'll be using this chance to rest.

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.950
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:55.910
<i>There are only a few minutes left until Hime-senpai goes on.</i>

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.620
Y-Yes?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.370
I'm opening the door.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.630
Thank you for your patience. Shiratori-san, it's about time for your appearance.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:08.380
<i>It's impossible for her to sing in that condition.</i>

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.590
Please come to the studio.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.760
W-Wait!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:12.640
Yes?

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.220
Um, I'm very sorry, but Hime-san is—

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.640
I'll be right there.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.350
Thank you.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.190
I'm sorry. Come on, it's time to go.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.740
But why? You're in horrible condition!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.280
Because I am Shiratori Hime.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:39.910
People are waiting for the idol, Shiratori Hime.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.420
So long as there is even a single person waiting,

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.080
I will go.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.250
So I'm going.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:06.440
Excuse me.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.320
Yume-chan?

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.320
Here's a hand massage.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.320
I'm not sure how effective it'll be,

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:19.830
but as your manager, I want to do everything I possibly can.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:30.590
Audience, it's what you've been waiting for!
Next up is Shiratori Hime-san's performance!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.850
Shiratori Hime, ready to go! {ep 10}

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.610
You did great!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:37.570
What's wrong?

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.570
Sorry, I was just so touched.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:46.990
Your massage felt very good.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.580
Thank you, Yume-chan.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:50.830
You're welcome!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.050
Here, I brought Auntie Smile's cookies as a present.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.430
Yay! I love those!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.300
You really didn't have to.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:07.600
I wanted to eat them myself.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.720
I'll brew us some tea.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:14.190
The cookies are quite sweet, so I think they'd go well with a bitter Darjeeling.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.110
Understood.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:20.940
So this is the legendary S4 tea party, 
the Gathering of Stars! {open to creativity}{let's not}

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.610
It's too lovely! {haruharu~}

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:28.120
I have one final question for you. 
Shiratori Hime-san, what is your goal going forward?

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:32.500
I've lived my entire life in the entertainment industry.{or I've lived my whole life in front of a camera/on stage" or something like that if you don't want to industry}

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:37.250
I would like to bring more and more excitement to the heart of Aikatsu. {Mizuki definitely said this before but I can't find where}

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:42.260
And because the snacks after a hard day's
 Aikatsu taste especially sweet.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.630
You got that right!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.260
Shiratori-san, thank you for your work today.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.640
That concludes all of our filming.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.390
I hope I lived up to your expectations.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:56.980
Without a doubt. We'll turn this into a great feature.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.650
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.650
Please accept this as a token of my gratitude.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.910
We'll gladly accept. Goodnight.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.660
Thank you.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.170
Hime-senpai, what's wrong?!

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:37.190
She's the kind of girl who can't turn off when a camera is rolling.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:41.190
To tell you the truth, Hime-chan's hobby is actually napping.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:45.200
I used to think that Hime-senpai was just a prodigy.

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:53.200
Of course, I still believe that she has incredible talent. But that's not all.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:57.670
She's kind to everyone, and always has a smile on her face.

00:21:57.670 --> 00:22:00.500
And she works harder than everyone else.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:04.460
That's what makes Hime-senpai so wonderful.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:11.810
I want to be more like Hime-senpai one day.

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:14.980
Whether you can depends on the effort you put in.

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:15.980
Yes!

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:21.980
I'll do the best Aikatsu I can!

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:05.000
We made a photo portrait of Hime-chan looking much cooler and mature than usual! {damn bromide}

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:09.260
Decorate it with sparkles and make it even more gorgeous!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:13.590
Oh no! Tsubasa-senpai's going to get mad at us!

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:16.300
Wait, what's that suspicious shadow on the back hills?

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:20.060
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:21.940
Soaring Girlfriend!{this just reminds me of hato-ful}

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:24.230
Become the first-star idol!
